<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 25.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 25.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell by 0.125 percentage points to 25.75 percent on Friday, from 25.875 percent on Thursday, Banco de Mexicosaid.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9558</p>
